lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/Irreducible.lean:12:# Geometrically Irreducible Schemes
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/Irreducible.lean:15:- `AlgebraicGeometry.GeometricallyIrreducible`:
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/Irreducible.lean:16:  We say that morphism `f : X ⟶ Y` is geometrically irreducible if for all `Spec K ⟶ Y` with `K`
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/Irreducible.lean:17:  a field, `X ×[Y] Spec K` is irreducible.
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/Irreducible.lean:19:- `GeometricallyIrreducible.iff_geometricallyIrreducible_fiber`:
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/Irreducible.lean:20:  A scheme is geometrically irreducible over `S` iff the fibers of all
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/Irreducible.lean:21:  `s : S` are geometrically irreducible.
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/Irreducible.lean:22:- `AlgebraicGeometry.GeometricallyIrreducible.irreducibleSpace`:
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/Irreducible.lean:23:  If `X` is geometrically irreducible and universally open (e.g. when flat + finite presentation),
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/Irreducible.lean:24:  over an irreducible scheme, then `X` is also irreducible.
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/Irreducible.lean:25:  In particular, the base change of a geometrically irreducible and universally open scheme to an
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/Irreducible.lean:26:  irreducible scheme is irreducible (by infer_instance).
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/Irreducible.lean:39:/-- We say that morphism `f : X ⟶ Y` is geometrically irreducible if for all `Spec K ⟶ Y` with `K`
