lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/SpecialLinearGroup.lean:16:This file defines the elements of the Special Linear group `SpecialLinearGroup n R`, consisting
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/SpecialLinearGroup.lean:18:the group structure on `SpecialLinearGroup n R` and the embedding into the general linear group
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/SpecialLinearGroup.lean:19:`GeneralLinearGroup R (n → R)`.
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/SpecialLinearGroup.lean:23:* `Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup` is the type of matrices with determinant 1
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/SpecialLinearGroup.lean:24:* `Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup.group` gives the group structure (under multiplication)
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/SpecialLinearGroup.lean:25:* `Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup.toGL` is the embedding `SLₙ(R) → GLₙ(R)`
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/SpecialLinearGroup.lean:33:The inverse operation in the `SpecialLinearGroup` is defined to be the adjugate
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/SpecialLinearGroup.lean:34:matrix, so that `SpecialLinearGroup n R` has a group structure for all `CommRing R`.
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/SpecialLinearGroup.lean:36:We define the elements of `SpecialLinearGroup` to be matrices, since we need to
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/SpecialLinearGroup.lean:37:compute their determinant. This is in contrast with `GeneralLinearGroup R M`,
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/SpecialLinearGroup.lean:40:We provide `Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup.hasCoeToFun` for convenience, but do not state any
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/SpecialLinearGroup.lean:41:lemmas about it, and use `Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup.coeFn_eq_coe` to eliminate it `⇑` in favor
