lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/RingTheory/Jacobson/Ring.lean:53:/-- A ring is a Jacobson ring if for every radical ideal `I`,
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/RingTheory/Jacobson/Ring.lean:54:the Jacobson radical of `I` is equal to `I`.
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/RingTheory/Jacobson/Ring.lean:55:See `isJacobsonRing_iff_prime_eq` and `isJacobsonRing_iff_sInf_maximal`
